## Execution Routing & Broker Integration (`config/execution_routing.json`)

The `execution_routing.json` file configures the connectivity layer between the algorithmic strategy engine and institutional trading venues. It governs Order/Execution Management System (OMS/EMS) protocols, pre-trade Transaction Cost Analysis (TCA), dynamic slippage tolerance models, and post-trade reporting pipes for the fund's custodian and Authorized Participants (APs).

---

### Key Schema Elements

* **`environment_connectivity`:**
  * `environment`: Active deployment mode (`production`, `staging_sandbox`, or `paper_trading`).
  * `oms_protocol`: Network communication standard (`FIX_4_4`, `REST_API`, `GRPC`).
  * `primary_broker_endpoint` / `backup_broker_endpoint`: Target routing gateways for institutional execution desks.
  * `session_credentials_vault_key`: Reference path to secure credential stores (API keys, FIX CompIDs, SSL certificates).
* **`algorithmic_execution_models`:**
  * `default_algo_strategy`: Default execution algorithm (e.g., `TWAP`, `VWAP`, `POV`, `MOC`, `ARRIVAL_PRICE`).
  * `max_participation_rate_pct`: Volume cap relative to current consolidated tape (e.g., max 10% of trailing volume) to limit market footprint.
  * `urgency_level`: Execution speed setting (`LOW`, `MEDIUM`, `HIGH`).
* **`slippage_and_tca_parameters`:**
  * `max_allowable_slippage_bps`: Maximum permissible price divergence against the decision price before halting fills.
  * `pre_trade_tca_model`: Theoretical impact model (`ALMGREN_CHRISS`, `LINEAR_SPREAD`, `SQUARE_ROOT_IMPACT`).
  * `target_tca_benchmark`: Post-trade benchmark metric (`ARRIVAL_PRICE`, `VWAP_INTERVAL`, `CLOSING_PRICE`).
* **`custodian_and_ap_reporting`:**
  * `custodian_sftp_endpoint`: Secure file pipeline for daily custodial trade confirms and aggregate cash settlements.
  * `ap_pcfr_reporting_endpoint`: Automated Portfolio Composition File (PCF) distribution endpoint to publish creation/redemption baskets before market open.
  * `reporting_format`: Institutional delivery payload specification (`SWIFT_MT515`, `CSV_EOD`, `FIX_CONFIRM`).

---

### Configuration Blueprint (`config/execution_routing.json`)

```json
{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "environment_connectivity": {
    "environment": "staging_sandbox",
    "oms_protocol": "FIX_4_4",
    "primary_broker_endpoint": "fix://order-gateway.inst-broker.com:9800",
    "backup_broker_endpoint": "fix://backup-gateway.inst-broker.com:9800",
    "session_credentials_vault_key": "VAULT/PROD/BROKER_FIX_CREDS",
    "timeout_seconds": 5
  },
  "algorithmic_execution_models": {
    "default_algo_strategy": "VWAP",
    "max_participation_rate_pct": 0.10,
    "urgency_level": "MEDIUM",
    "min_clip_size_shares": 100,
    "discretionary_price_offset_ticks": 1
  },
  "slippage_and_tca_parameters": {
    "max_allowable_slippage_bps": 15.0,
    "pre_trade_tca_model": "SQUARE_ROOT_IMPACT",
    "target_tca_benchmark": "ARRIVAL_PRICE",
    "cancel_on_excessive_slippage": true
  },
  "custodian_and_ap_reporting": {
    "custodian_sftp_endpoint": "sftp://[custody-drop.globalbank.com/trades/inbound](https://custody-drop.globalbank.com/trades/inbound)",
    "ap_pcf_reporting_endpoint": "[https://api.etf-services.com/v1/pcf/publish](https://api.etf-services.com/v1/pcf/publish)",
    "reporting_format": "CSV_EOD",
    "transmit_pcf_cutoff_time": "08:30:00"
  }
}
